        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Daniel Bejar, Makoto Koshinaka, Sydney Hermant, Carey Mercer, Spencer Krug\n- Music Groups: Hello, Blue Roses, Swan Lake, Destroyer, The New Pornographers, Frog Eyes, Blackout Beach, Wolf Parade, Sunset Rubdown\n- Places: Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada, Moto Azabu, Tokyo, Japan, Thailand\n- Roles: singer-songwriters, actors, models, visual artists\n\nFacts:\n- Daniel Bejar was born on October 4, 1972.\n- Daniel Bejar is an independent singer-songwriter from Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada.\n- Makoto Koshinaka was born on July 15, 1980 in Moto Azabu, Tokyo.\n- Starting in 1999, Makoto Koshinaka was active in both Japan and Thailand as a Japanese singer, songwriter, actor, and model.\n- Hello, Blue Roses is a Canadian musical collaboration involving Dan Bejar of Destroyer and The New Pornographers and his girlfriend Sydney Hermant, a visual artist from Vancouver.\n- Swan Lake is a Canadian indie supergroup comprising Carey Mercer of Frog Eyes and Blackout Beach, Daniel Bejar of Destroyer, Hello, Blue Roses, and The New Pornographers, and Spencer Krug of Wolf Parade, Sunset Rubdown, and Frog Eyes.",
